# Netlify redirects (https://docs.netlify.com/routing/redirects/)
# www → non-www, keeping the rest of the path. The "!" forces the redirect
# even though a file exists at that path. http → https is automatic on
# Netlify once HTTPS is enabled for the domain.

https://www.jibinjohnson.in/*  https://jibinjohnson.in/:splat  301!
http://www.jibinjohnson.in/*   https://jibinjohnson.in/:splat  301!
